                                "sense_id": "6f4528c6-ffbd-3fec-9e18-5a5ba70ef9b2",
                                "text": "De nooduitgang moet altijd vrij zijn van obstakels.",
                                "translation": "The emergency exit must always be free of obstacles.",
                                "english": "The emergency exit must always be free of obstacles."
                            },
                            {
